{"4028450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Stream", "steam_appid": 4028450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Live. Stay Alive. </strong><br><br><br><strong>In Dark Stream, you play a fearless content creator chasing clout by livestreaming from a house</strong> rumored to be haunted for decades. But this isn’t just exploration, you’re stepping directly into active paranormal events. Armed with your laptop, a flickering flashlight, and a live chat feed, you’ll push deeper into the house, uncover its violent past, and survive the encounters that react to <i>you</i>.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your only reliable tools are your equipment and your instincts.</strong> Objects shift with intent. Sounds linger where they shouldn’t. Whispers crawl through the static like they’ve been waiting for an audience. The problem is figuring out <i>what it wants.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/261ac3f177d7b7501be7a5f26b70045f.poster.avif?t=1788192965\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/261ac3f177d7b7501be7a5f26b70045f.webm?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/261ac3f177d7b7501be7a5f26b70045f.mp4?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each encounter is a tense, interactive investigation. </strong>Observe, interpret, and experiment to understand what’s happening before the nightmare takes hold. Correct actions stabilize the anomaly, revealing the truth. Mistakes escalate the situation, turning the environment unpredictable and  hostile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/4b3fccd6dce30a80d893d9e2dbc4d349.poster.avif?t=1788192965\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/4b3fccd6dce30a80d893d9e2dbc4d349.webm?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/4b3fccd6dce30a80d893d9e2dbc4d349.mp4?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’re never alone on stream. </strong>A fully integrated Twitch chat reacts in real time. Will they support you when things get bad, feed the chaos, or simply spam “F” while everything falls apart? Either way… they’re staying until the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/f0babce809aeadcfaac19a3270d3e28e.poster.avif?t=1788192965\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/f0babce809aeadcfaac19a3270d3e28e.webm?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/f0babce809aeadcfaac19a3270d3e28e.mp4?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piece together the story of the haunting</strong> as you unlock more rooms. Each anomaly is its own twisted performance, but together they reveal something bigger: hidden in the rooms, the objects, and the way the house changes around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/1ee0e601d675296694a2d8105e01d32d.poster.avif?t=1788192965\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/1ee0e601d675296694a2d8105e01d32d.webm?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/1ee0e601d675296694a2d8105e01d32d.mp4?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stay Live. Stay Sharp. And Whatever You Do… Keep the Content Coming.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Live. Stay Alive. </strong><br><br><br><strong>In Dark Stream, you play a fearless content creator chasing clout by livestreaming from a house</strong> rumored to be haunted for decades. But this isn’t just exploration, you’re stepping directly into active paranormal events. Armed with your laptop, a flickering flashlight, and a live chat feed, you’ll push deeper into the house, uncover its violent past, and survive the encounters that react to <i>you</i>.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your only reliable tools are your equipment and your instincts.</strong> Objects shift with intent. Sounds linger where they shouldn’t. Whispers crawl through the static like they’ve been waiting for an audience. The problem is figuring out <i>what it wants.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/261ac3f177d7b7501be7a5f26b70045f.poster.avif?t=1788192965\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item