/apps/4028450/extras/f0babce809aeadcfaac19a3270d3e28e.webm?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/f0babce809aeadcfaac19a3270d3e28e.mp4?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Piece together the story of the haunting</strong> as you unlock more rooms. Each anomaly is its own twisted performance, but together they reveal something bigger: hidden in the rooms, the objects, and the way the house changes around you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/1ee0e601d675296694a2d8105e01d32d.poster.avif?t=1788192965\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/1ee0e601d675296694a2d8105e01d32d.webm?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/extras/1ee0e601d675296694a2d8105e01d32d.mp4?t=1788192965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stay Live. Stay Sharp. And Whatever You Do… Keep the Content Coming.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A desperate livestream. A house that shouldn’t be entered. A Twitch chat that won’t stay quiet. Survive the subathon as a disgraced creator, as the haunting awakens and your audience decides your fate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028450/9e5d486fed7e7031ba2433f9ba1431587583e518/header.jpg?t=1788192965", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s